  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "fields": [
        {
          "example": "周杰伦",
          "help_en": "Query keyword  ",
          "help_zh": "查询关键字",
          "name": "query",
          "options": [
            "--query"
          ],
          "raw_name": "Query",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "music",
          "help_en": "The search scope: music or audio.  \nInput parameter enumeration: music | program  ",
          "help_zh": "搜索的范围音乐或者音频\n入参枚举 ：music | program",
          "name": "cate",
          "options": [
            "--cate"
          ],
          "raw_name": "Cate",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "singer",
          "help_en": "When `cate` is `music`, `subCate` can be omitted.  \nIf `subCate` is provided, it can be one of the following:  \n`song` (Song), `singer` (Artist), `album` (Album).  \n\nWhen `cate` is `program`, `subCate` can be omitted.  \nIf `subCate` is provided, it can be one of the following:  \n`album` (Album), `audio` (Program Audio), `radio` (Radio Station)",
          "help_zh": "当cate 是music时 可以不传subCate  如果传subCate 可以为 ：\nsong （歌曲）、 singer（艺人） 、album （专辑）\n\n当cate是program时 可以不传subCate  \n如果传subCate 可以为 ：\nalbum （专辑）、audio（节目音频）、radio（电台）",
          "name": "sub_cate",
          "options": [
            "--sub-cate"
          ],
          "raw_name": "SubCate",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "false",
          "help_en": "Whether to query albums  ",
          "help_zh": "是否查询专辑",
          "name": "query_album",
          "options": [
            "--query-album"
          ],
          "raw_name": "QueryAlbum",
          "required": false,
          "type": "bool"
        },
        {
          "example": "1",
          "help_en": "Page number  ",
          "help_zh": "页码",
          "name": "page_num",
          "options": [
            "--page-num"
          ],
          "raw_name": "PageNum",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "example": "10",
          "help_en": "Number of records per page  ",
          "help_zh": "页记录数",
          "name": "page_size",
          "options": [
            "--page-size"
          ],
          "raw_name": "PageSize",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        }
      ],
      "help_en": "Request Parameters  ",
      "help_zh": "请求参数",
      "location": "formData",
      "name": "request",
      "options": [
        "--request"
      ],
      "param_style": "json",
      "raw_name": "Request",
      "required": true,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "fields": [
        {
          "example": "12**45",
          "help_en": "The value corresponding to the encoding type.\n\nWhen the encoding type is SKILL_ID, the value is the Skill ID of the application.  \nWhen the encoding type is PACKAGE_NAME, the value is the packageName of the corresponding client app",
          "help_zh": "编码类型对应的值\n\n编码类型是SKILL_ID时，其值为应用的Skill ID。\n编码类型是PACKAGE_NAME时，其值为对应客户端App的packageName",
          "name": "encode_key",
          "options": [
            "--encode-key"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeKey",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "PACKAGE_NAME",
          "help_en": "Encoding type. There are multiple ways to obtain the user identifier for Tmall Genie, and each method corresponds to a different encoding type.  \n\n`PACKAGE_NAME`: APK package name, used for the Android application customer link.  \n`SKILL_ID`: Skill ID, used for the cloud-based link",
          "help_zh": "编码类型，获取天猫精灵的用户标识的途径有多种，不同途径对应不同的编码类型。\n\nPACKAGE_NAME：apk包名，Android应用客户链路的编码类型。\nSKILL_ID：技能ID，云端链路的编码类型",
          "name": "encode_type",
          "options": [
            "--encode-type"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeType",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "HOFF****my7Iw=",
          "help_en": "User identifier, set to either `userOpenId` or `userUnionId`",
          "help_zh": "用户标识，设置为userOpenId或userUnionId",
          "name": "id",
          "options": [
            "--id"
          ],
          "raw_name": "Id",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "OPEN_ID",
          "help_en": "The Type of the User ID.\n\nOPEN_ID: The default User ID identity.  \nUNION_ID: The organization-dimension User ID identity. This value is available only after an organization has been requested on the Tmall Genie Skills Open Platform",
          "help_zh": "用户Id的类型\n\nOPEN_ID：默认的用户ID标识。\nUNION_ID: 组织维度的用户ID标识，在天猫精灵技能应用开放平台申请过组织后才会有该值",
          "name": "id_type",
          "options": [
            "--id-type"
          ],
          "raw_name": "IdType",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "1**2",
          "help_en": "Organization ID. Required when `IdType` is `UNION_ID`",
          "help_zh": "组织ID，如果IdType为UNION_ID时必填",
          "name": "organization_id",
          "options": [
            "--organization-id"
          ],
          "raw_name": "OrganizationId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "help_en": "User identification information",
      "help_zh": "用户标识信息",
      "location": "query",
