      "raw_name": "UserInfo",
      "required": true,
      "type": "object"
    },
    {
      "fields": [
        {
          "example": "12**45",
          "help_en": "Value corresponding to the encoding type.  \n\nWhen the encoding type is `SKILL_ID`, the value is the application's Skill ID.  \nWhen the encoding type is `PACKAGE_NAME`, the value is the `packageName` of the corresponding client app",
          "help_zh": "编码类型对应的值\n\n编码类型是SKILL_ID时，其值为应用的Skill ID。\n编码类型是PACKAGE_NAME时，其值为对应客户端App的packageName",
          "name": "encode_key",
          "options": [
            "--encode-key"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeKey",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "PACKAGE_NAME",
          "help_en": "Encoding type. There are multiple ways to obtain the device ID for Tmall Genie, and each method corresponds to a different encoding type.  \n\n`PACKAGE_NAME`: APK package name, used for the Android application customer link.  \n`SKILL_ID`: Skill ID, used for the cloud-based link",
          "help_zh": "编码类型，获取天猫精灵的设备标识的途径有多种，不同途径对应不同的编码类型。\n\nPACKAGE_NAME：apk包名，Android应用客户链路的编码类型。\nSKILL_ID：技能ID，云端链路的编码类型",
          "name": "encode_type",
          "options": [
            "--encode-type"
          ],
          "raw_name": "EncodeType",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "DAFE****ce3ej=",
          "help_en": "Device ID, set to either `deviceOpenId` or `deviceUnionId`",
          "help_zh": "设备标识，设置为deviceOpenId或deviceUnionId",
          "name": "id",
          "options": [
            "--id"
          ],
          "raw_name": "Id",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "OPEN_ID",
          "help_en": "Type of device ID.  \n\n`OPEN_ID`: Default device ID identity.  \n`UNION_ID`: Organization-dimension device ID identity. This value is available only after an organization has been registered on the Tmall Genie Skill Application Open Platform",
          "help_zh": "设备Id的类型\n\nOPEN_ID：默认的设备ID标识。\nUNION_ID: 组织维度的设备ID标识，在天猫精灵技能应用开放平台申请过组织后才会有该值",
          "name": "id_type",
          "options": [
            "--id-type"
          ],
          "raw_name": "IdType",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "1**2",
          "help_en": "Organization ID. Required when `IdType` is `UNION_ID`",
          "help_zh": "组织ID，如果IdType为UNION_ID时必填",
          "name": "organization_id",
          "options": [
            "--organization-id"
          ],
          "raw_name": "OrganizationId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        }
      ],
      "help_en": "Device identification information",
      "help_zh": "设备标识信息",
      "location": "query",
